+| `LIGHTNING-K10` | Verified / UE 5.8.1 | Emitter `bLocalSpace=false` (default) plus a location-less spawn puts all particles at world origin — actor-placed systems render off-camera. Flip via `SetEmitterData` (param name is `emitter`, not `emitterRef`; round-trip the full GetEmitterData `propertyValues` blob with `"bLocalSpace": true`). With local space, empty anchor user-params anchor the bolt at the actor. |
